## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Artillery Burst (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when your team already has early magic penetration and Pharsa needs more frequent wave clear and ultimate angles.; Glowing Wand over Clock of Destiny when Use when anti-heal is needed before the first Turtle or the enemy front line relies on shields and regen.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one diver can reach your ultimate perch before Flicker creates enough space.
- Total cost: 12040 gold

Default mid build for ranked games where Pharsa can farm a stable two-item damage core and play long-range objective zones.

### Sustain Breaker (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings
- Core: Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Lightning Truncheon over Wishing Lantern when Use against squishier drafts where fast backline burst matters more than current-HP damage.; Genius Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team has multiple magic damage sources that can use the early Magic Defense reduction.; Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your front line needs extra slow value to keep enemies inside Feathered Air Strike zones.
- Total cost: 12060 gold

Anti-sustain and front-to-back build that uses burn, current-HP damage, and penetration to punish tankier objective setups.

### Anti-Dive Reset (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive threat is damage-heavy but not control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude and Purify together.; Holy Crystal over Fleeting Time when Use when fights are decided by one clean ultimate channel instead of repeated ultimate resets.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in late Lord defense when your death would immediately lose the base or the final objective.
- Total cost: 10980 gold

Defensive mid setup for heavy pick and dive drafts where Pharsa must survive the first lockout before resetting into a second artillery angle.

